<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>404 - 页面不存在</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="error-container">
      <div class="error-content">
        <div class="error-code">404</div>
        <div class="error-icon">
          <svg
            width="80"
            height="80"
            viewBox="0 0 48 48"
            fill="none"
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
          >
            <path
              d="M24 44C35.0457 44 44 35.0457 44 24C44 12.9543 35.0457 4 24 4C12.9543 4 4 12.9543 4 24C4 35.0457 12.9543 44 24 44Z"
              fill="#FFF4F0"
              stroke="#ff976a"
              stroke-width="2"></path>
            <path
              d="M24 12V28"
              stroke="#ff976a"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
            <path
              d="M24 35V36"
              stroke="#ff976a"
              stroke-width="3"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="error-title">页面不见了</div>
        <div class="error-message">您访问的页面可能已被删除或暂时不可用</div>
        <div class="action-buttons">
          <a href="/" class="home-button">返回首页</a>
          <button class="back-button" onclick="window.history.back()">返回上页</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial,
      sans-serif;
  }

  .error-container {
    height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    background-color: var(--van-background-2, #f7f8fa);
    padding: 0 20px;
  }

  .error-content {
    max-width: 500px;
    text-align: center;
    animation: fadeIn 0.5s ease-in-out;
  }

  .error-code {
    font-size: 120px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: var(--van-gray-5, #969799);
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    text-shadow: 4px 4px 0px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
  }

  .error-icon {
    margin: 20px 0;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .error-title {
    font-size: 24px;
    color: var(--van-text-color, #323233);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    font-weight: bold;
  }

  .error-message {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--van-text-color-2, #969799);
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }

  .action-buttons {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .home-button {
    background-color: var(--van-primary-color, #1989fa);
    color: white;
    border: none;
    padding: 12px 24px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 16px;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background-color 0.3s;
  }

  .home-button:hover {
    background-color: var(--van-primary-color-dark, #0570db);
  }

  .back-button {
    background-color: var(--van-gray-5, #969799);
    color: white;
    border: none;
    padding: 12px 24px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 16px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background-color 0.3s;
  }

  .back-button:hover {
    background-color: var(--van-gray-6, #646566);
  }

  @keyframes fadeIn {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(-20px);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .error-code {
      font-size: 100px;
    }

    .error-title {
      font-size: 20px;
    }

    .action-buttons {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 12px;
    }
  }
</style>
